   "lines": [
    "Rather unwell and",
    "feverish; had a",
    "terribly distinct",
    "and weird dream",
    "about [illegible]. It",
    "has made me",
    "feel very sad.",
    "Now and then sud-",
    "-den memories of",
    "him are so vivid",
    "that I can almost",
    "feel as if he were",
    "by me; but it",
    "is only almost,",
    "and when I fully",
    "realize this I feel, oh",
    "so lonely! \"The Lord",
    "is my comforter\"."
   ],
